<title>USA: IPL Systems sees Q4 loss $1 mln.</title>
<headline>IPL Systems sees Q4 loss $1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MAYNARD, Mass. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPL Systems Inc said Monday it expects to post a fourth-quarter loss of $1,000,000 on revenues of about $2,400,000.</p>
<p>The company lost $380,000, or $0.07 per share, on revenues of $7,016,000 in the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>The First Call concensus estimate projects a per-share loss of $0.05 in the current fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Total current assets were expected to be $1 million below the level at September 30, 1996.  Cash is expected to be slightly below the level at September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Comparative dollar figures were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
